<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.300" end="00:00:07.900" style="s2">Fill the basket before dark. Don&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.700" end="00:00:07.900" style="s2">back until it&#39;s full.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.600" end="00:00:13.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.790" end="00:00:13.810" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.400" end="00:00:17.800" style="s2">No, no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.700" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go away.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.800" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid?</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.000" end="00:00:25.700" style="s2">Don&#39;t come closer.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.925" end="00:00:27.700" style="s2">[laughter] I can&#39;t control it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.700" end="00:00:30.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re afraid of me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.700" end="00:00:31.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid I&#39;ll hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.200" end="00:00:32.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.000" end="00:00:34.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.800" end="00:00:36.600" style="s2">One breath.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.200" end="00:00:36.600" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:45.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Change back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.300" end="00:00:46.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, you&#39;re coming back WITH</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.200" end="00:00:48.300" style="s2">US NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.300" end="00:00:50.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, I&#39;m not going back. I&#39;ll come back</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.300" end="00:00:52.900" style="s2">for you. Then promise me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.100" end="00:00:52.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I PROMISE.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.000" end="00:01:00.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO TOLD YOU TO STOP? I&#39;ve kept you fed</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.900" end="00:01:02.200" style="s2">for the past 15 years. You should have</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.400" end="00:01:05.900" style="s2">died long ago.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.200" end="00:01:09.600" style="s2">This place reeks of filth. Disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.900" end="00:01:14.400" style="s2">Sweetheart, get away. Don&#39;t go near her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.600" end="00:01:14.400" style="s2">Your dress is worth more than her life.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.100" end="00:01:24.400" style="s2">it&#39;s all I have left of you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.800" end="00:01:24.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, get up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.100" end="00:01:28.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid,</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.300" end="00:01:31.600" style="s2">don&#39;t give it to anyone. Live.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.900" end="00:01:31.600" style="s2">My Elara.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.300" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to be alone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.200" end="00:01:39.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out there already.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.600" end="00:01:44.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One day</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.900" end="00:01:46.100" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave this place.</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.200" end="00:01:47.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you adopt a little girl 15 years</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.100" end="00:01:49.800" style="s2">ago?</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.800" end="00:01:51.700" style="s2">She should be wearing this necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.800" end="00:01:53.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you looking for her?</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.700" end="00:01:55.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She may be the missing heir to the</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.000" end="00:01:55.400" style="s2">throne.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.100" end="00:01:59.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The heir.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.100" end="00:02:05.292" style="s2">Finally. found it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.392" end="00:02:12.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, it&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.492" end="00:02:15.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will they truly believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.892" end="00:02:18.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, I found you on that blizzard</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.292" end="00:02:18.692" style="s2">night 15 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.992" end="00:02:22.191" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lord, it&#39;s her. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.492" end="00:02:26.292" style="s2">The child I found 15 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.792" end="00:02:31.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the queen&#39;s necklace.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.392" end="00:02:34.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The necklace matches,</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.292" end="00:02:35.892" style="s2">but it doesn&#39;t prove your bloodline.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.092" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may return to the palace only as a</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.892" end="00:02:40.192" style="s2">throne claimant.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.992" end="00:02:42.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only a throne claimant?</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.192" end="00:02:44.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the bloodstone is restored,</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.292" end="00:02:46.792" style="s2">the crown will re-verify your bloodline.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.592" end="00:02:46.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alice.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.492" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">Hold her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.992" end="00:02:55.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is she?</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.592" end="00:02:58.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A mad maid.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.492" end="00:02:58.392" style="s2">She could hurt someone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.492" end="00:03:04.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know my mother gave that to me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.992" end="00:03:04.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is why I can&#39;t let you stay.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.692" end="00:03:11.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.692" end="00:03:13.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found you a new place. Valencia&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.192" end="00:03:15.292" style="s2">Royal Palace needs a personal attendant.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.792" end="00:03:18.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard that the king turns into a</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.292" end="00:03:21.492" style="s2">monster whenever he LOSES CONTROL.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.192" end="00:03:21.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET [screaming] ME GO!</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.992" end="00:03:32.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TAKE THE MEDICINE TO HIS MAJESTY</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.292" end="00:03:32.992" style="s2">DOWNSTAIRS.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.992" end="00:03:43.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His majesty has shifted again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.892" end="00:03:54.692" style="s2">He&#39;s hurting himself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.292" end="00:03:56.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can anyone get the medicine to him?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.692" end="00:03:58.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whoever can do it will become his</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.292" end="00:04:00.694" style="s2">majesty&#39;s personal attendant.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.692" end="00:04:03.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I stay by the king&#39;s side, I can find</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.694" end="00:04:03.394" style="s2">out who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.494" end="00:04:08.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.094" end="00:04:10.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m willing to be your personal</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.094" end="00:04:14.294" style="s2">attendant. Please give me your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.994" end="00:04:14.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not afraid of me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.694" end="00:04:20.394" style="s2">Do you know what being my personal</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.694" end="00:04:22.794" style="s2">attendant means? You would have to calm</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.394" end="00:04:25.394" style="s2">a beast that could lose control at any</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.794" end="00:04:25.394" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.694" end="00:04:30.518" style="s2">Her touch is driving the obsidian curse</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.494" end="00:04:31.394" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.518" end="00:04:32.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.394" end="00:04:33.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does that prove I&#39;m here of my own free</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.894" end="00:04:35.813" style="s2">will?</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.793" end="00:04:35.813" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.963" end="00:04:45.494" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.194" end="00:04:48.294" style="s2">His Majesty</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.494" end="00:04:50.168" style="s2">shifted back.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.294" end="00:04:52.188" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did she do?</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.168" end="00:04:52.188" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your touch</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">can turn me human again.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.923" end="00:05:07.594" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.094" end="00:05:09.194" style="s2">Who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.594" end="00:05:11.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The people who sent me here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.194" end="00:05:14.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.094" end="00:05:14.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was sold to the palace.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:18.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rowan,</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.094" end="00:05:19.094" style="s2">bring in the people who sent her.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.333" end="00:05:20.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.094" end="00:05:22.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty,</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.394" end="00:05:24.894" style="s2">they all came to serve willingly.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.094" end="00:05:26.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do willing people arrive bound?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.894" end="00:05:27.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She fought us on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.694" end="00:05:29.694" style="s2">I only</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.194" end="00:05:29.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.694" end="00:05:35.094" style="s2">Forging debt contracts,</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.794" end="00:05:36.894" style="s2">trafficking civilians.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.094" end="00:05:39.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MERCY, YOUR MAJESTY.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.894" end="00:05:42.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PUT him in the dungeon.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.694" end="00:05:45.394" style="s2">Release all the girls sent here tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.194" end="00:05:47.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUR MAJESTY, PLEASE.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.394" end="00:05:50.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; INCLUDING YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.394" end="00:05:53.094" style="s2">Your contract is gone.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.394" end="00:05:53.094" style="s2">You can leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.094" end="00:06:01.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.294" end="00:06:01.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.394" end="00:06:06.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother left me this necklace. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.594" end="00:06:08.295" style="s2">took it away from me yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.695" end="00:06:10.495" style="s2">They said I might not be who I thought I</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.295" end="00:06:13.895" style="s2">was.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.495" end="00:06:13.895" style="s2">I need to find out who I really am.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.995" end="00:06:18.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you want to stay at the palace?</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.595" end="00:06:20.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The royal archives hold records from 15</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.595" end="00:06:23.095" style="s2">years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.895" end="00:06:24.995" style="s2">Give me access to the archives and I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.095" end="00:06:26.495" style="s2">help you control the shift.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.995" end="00:06:27.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you bargaining with a king?</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.495" end="00:06:30.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.395" end="00:06:30.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bronze toga.</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.795" end="00:06:34.495" style="s2">The royal archives.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.695" end="00:06:37.195" style="s2">You may look through the records freely</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.495" end="00:06:39.495" style="s2">except for sealed archives.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.195" end="00:06:39.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.295" end="00:06:46.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.095" end="00:06:46.695" style="s2">Stay by my side starting tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.195" end="00:06:54.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seven years old.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.995" end="00:06:54.595" style="s2">Fled west. Astor and Venecia.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.495" end="00:07:02.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t just your past.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.695" end="00:07:02.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll find out the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.895" end="00:07:10.895" style="s2">Your Majesty, you don&#39;t have to do this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.595" end="00:07:10.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.095" end="00:07:13.795" style="s2">These hands have worked too hard to be</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.495" end="00:07:17.195" style="s2">hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:17.195" style="s2">You weren&#39;t born to be hurt either.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.695" end="00:07:24.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.130" end="00:07:26.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.095" end="00:07:27.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you were brave.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.195" end="00:07:30.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.795" end="00:07:32.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll have someone bring food.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.795" end="00:07:34.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t a maid&#39;s uniform.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.695" end="00:07:37.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty says you don&#39;t have to wear</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.195" end="00:07:37.195" style="s2">the standard uniform.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.195" end="00:07:41.495" style="s2">Cael.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.995" end="00:07:45.395" style="s2">Don&#39;t rub it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.295" end="00:07:46.595" style="s2">Clean it first.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.395" end="00:07:48.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.595" end="00:07:50.795" style="s2">Should we take you to the stone chamber?</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.695" end="00:07:50.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.295" end="00:07:53.895" style="s2">Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.695" end="00:07:55.895" style="s2">You suppressed the beast shift on your</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.895" end="00:07:57.195" style="s2">own.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.895" end="00:07:59.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take him to physician Alden for</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.195" end="00:08:00.195" style="s2">follow-up treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.495" end="00:08:03.795" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.195" end="00:08:03.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you come touch me first?</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.395" end="00:08:09.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I trusted you, Your Majesty. You</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.895" end="00:08:10.997" style="s2">could it back yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.497" end="00:08:12.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were that sure I wouldn&#39;t lose</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.997" end="00:08:13.897" style="s2">control completely.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.397" end="00:08:15.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you could do it from the night we</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:16.997" style="s2">met.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.197" end="00:08:19.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s helping him get the curse under</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.997" end="00:08:19.797" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.597" end="00:08:23.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.045" end="00:08:24.797" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.897" end="00:08:28.197" style="s2">Cael?</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.797" end="00:08:28.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.997" end="00:08:34.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, don&#39;t shut me out.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.075" end="00:08:42.597" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.040" end="00:08:43.997" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.597" end="00:08:45.971" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.997" end="00:08:47.991" style="s2">You didn&#39;t hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.971" end="00:08:47.991" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.497" end="00:08:52.097" style="s2">You&#39;re still in there. I know you are.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.141" end="00:08:59.126" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.106" end="00:08:59.126" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.036" end="00:09:02.697" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.697" end="00:09:05.697" style="s2">Did I hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.697" end="00:09:06.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You scared me, but you saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.697" end="00:09:08.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is his Majesty changing again?</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.997" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clear this entire floor.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.897" end="00:09:11.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, move.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.997" end="00:09:19.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The throne claimant is coming.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.497" end="00:09:21.197" style="s2">Then let us see what&#39;s happening here.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.997" end="00:09:22.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cael?</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.197" end="00:09:23.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.297" end="00:09:27.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:27.297" style="s2">No one got hurt last night.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.097" end="00:09:34.797" style="s2">It all matches.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.997" end="00:09:37.297" style="s2">Serena?</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.797" end="00:09:37.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know her?</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.597" end="00:09:42.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow night,</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.197" end="00:09:42.797" style="s2">they&#39;ll meet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.597" end="00:09:50.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to stay in the banquet hall.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.597" end="00:09:50.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She may recognize you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.597" end="00:09:55.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what I want.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.297" end="00:10:00.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stand by my side.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.397" end="00:10:02.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a maid, not a shield.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.597" end="00:10:02.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.197" end="00:10:09.297" style="s2">If she proves to be the heir, a marriage</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.997" end="00:10:09.297" style="s2">alliance would be our safest course.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.697" end="00:10:12.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She isn&#39;t even here and you&#39;re already</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.298" end="00:10:14.598" style="s2">planning a marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.698" end="00:10:15.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only thinking of the kingdom, Your</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.598" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.498" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Aster delegation has arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.898" end="00:10:27.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s actually Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.198" end="00:10:29.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make sure of what you saw before you</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.698" end="00:10:30.798" style="s2">act.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.198" end="00:10:33.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.798" end="00:10:35.998" style="s2">no one will silence me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.298" end="00:10:37.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her Highness Serena, the containment to</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.998" end="00:10:40.098" style="s2">the Aster throne.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.898" end="00:10:42.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, Alster sends its</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.098" end="00:10:42.698" style="s2">greetings.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.898" end="00:10:51.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, long time no see.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.698" end="00:10:54.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness knows her?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.498" end="00:10:54.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I know her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.098" end="00:11:00.298" style="s2">How is she here?</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.898" end="00:11:01.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It seems you have a great deal to talk</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.298" end="00:11:03.498" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.098" end="00:11:03.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We do.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.998" end="00:11:11.398" style="s2">Why are you still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.098" end="00:11:14.598" style="s2">Because you couldn&#39;t kill me. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.398" end="00:11:17.598" style="s2">only a maid now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.598" end="00:11:21.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then open it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.598" end="00:11:21.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, YOU RUINED MY GOWN.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.398" end="00:11:27.298" style="s2">SHE tried to steal a royal relic.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.698" end="00:11:34.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who allowed you to touch her?</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.698" end="00:11:34.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She insulted Aster&#39;s heir.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.598" end="00:11:38.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty is about to shift.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.098" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.298" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">Stop at yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.898" end="00:11:49.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.098" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">She&#39;s not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.798" end="00:11:56.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why her?</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.698" end="00:11:58.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A marriage between our kingdoms would</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.498" end="00:12:02.298" style="s2">bring the troops fastest.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.798" end="00:12:03.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am willing to shoulder my royal duty.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.298" end="00:12:05.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An alliance shouldn&#39;t be bought with a</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.498" end="00:12:09.298" style="s2">marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.398" end="00:12:11.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The crown must consider stability too.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.298" end="00:12:12.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can discuss troops</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.198" end="00:12:14.399" style="s2">not my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.498" end="00:12:17.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.399" end="00:12:17.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t even consider it?</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.799" end="00:12:23.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t consider someone chosen for me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.299" end="00:12:31.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to reject a kingdom</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.499" end="00:12:31.299" style="s2">because of me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.299" end="00:12:37.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my decision, not yours.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.299" end="00:12:42.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll make my own choice.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.299" end="00:12:48.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll pay the price.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.399" end="00:12:51.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone crossed out my name.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.299" end="00:12:51.999" style="s2">We don&#39;t need maids for hunts.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.999" end="00:12:56.799" style="s2">My duties include riding with the king.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.899" end="00:13:01.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give her a horse.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.099" end="00:13:03.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, you really can&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.199" end="00:13:06.499" style="s2">without her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.699" end="00:13:06.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my decision.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.699" end="00:13:17.299" style="s2">You&#39;re more careful now.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.999" end="00:13:20.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After you&#39;ve been sold once, you learn.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.299" end="00:13:20.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just get her away from him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.699" end="00:13:24.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, let something happen to her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.799" end="00:13:29.799" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll see if the king loses</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.199" end="00:13:29.799" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.999" end="00:13:34.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay close.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.799" end="00:13:38.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The reins have snapped.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.699" end="00:13:42.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on to me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.799" end="00:13:45.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop the horse first.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.799" end="00:13:54.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s safe now.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.699" end="00:13:59.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.899" end="00:14:03.899" style="s2">This wasn&#39;t an accident.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.899" end="00:14:10.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone didn&#39;t want me here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.199" end="00:14:10.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Search the stables immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.999" end="00:14:14.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Preserve the evidence first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.099" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She rides with me until we return to</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.701" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">camp.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:24.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone tampered with the fence.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.301" end="00:14:24.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.501" end="00:14:30.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.701" end="00:14:35.501" style="s2">He&#39;s about to shift.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.101" end="00:14:41.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone move back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.101" end="00:14:45.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.901" end="00:14:45.301" style="s2">Don&#39;t let it choose for you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.225" end="00:14:47.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.880" end="00:14:50.801" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.601" end="00:14:50.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty stopped it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.120" end="00:14:55.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.701" end="00:14:57.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always step between danger and</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.101" end="00:14:57.901" style="s2">everyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.901" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time you said danger drove you to</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.201" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.401" end="00:15:12.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re completely lucid now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.701" end="00:15:14.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this time there&#39;s no excuse.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.301" end="00:15:16.301" style="s2">Making him lose control isn&#39;t enough</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.201" end="00:15:17.501" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.301" end="00:15:19.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These crystals are only meant to be</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.501" end="00:15:21.901" style="s2">sealed away.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.001" end="00:15:23.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only need it to amplify the curse.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.901" end="00:15:24.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;ll be even more dangerous near the</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.501" end="00:15:25.901" style="s2">underground vein.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.401" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.901" end="00:15:29.401" style="s2">Because it&#39;s beneath the palace.</p>
<p begin="00:15:29.701" end="00:15:34.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The delegation wants you to verify the</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.401" end="00:15:34.601" style="s2">old necklace customs.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.901" end="00:15:41.901" style="s2">Since when are you this helpful?</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.801" end="00:15:41.901" style="s2">Don&#39;t flatter yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.701" end="00:15:53.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just this once.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:53.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once is enough.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.801" end="00:16:01.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was meant to lure me away.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.701" end="00:16:06.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty&#39;s medicine was just</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.001" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">delivered.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.301" end="00:16:12.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seal the dispensary.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.101" end="00:16:12.501" style="s2">I&#39;m going to find His Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.401" end="00:16:16.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He lost control the moment he drank the</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.001" end="00:16:18.801" style="s2">medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.101" end="00:16:18.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eyes on you, Rhett.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.102" end="00:16:28.502" style="s2">Cael, look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.502" end="00:16:31.402" style="s2">It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.502" end="00:16:33.646" style="s2">Don&#39;t listen to anything else.</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.402" end="00:16:35.666" style="s2">Come back.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.646" end="00:16:35.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.902" end="00:16:40.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something wrong with the</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.802" end="00:16:40.302" style="s2">medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.602" end="00:16:46.802" style="s2">The floor is reacting to it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.102" end="00:16:51.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t ordinary poisoning.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.002" end="00:16:59.302" style="s2">Someone is using the power beneath us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:17:01.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She saw the main vein.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.302" end="00:17:04.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seal the dispensary. No one leaves the</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.602" end="00:17:04.102" style="s2">palace.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.902" end="00:17:09.502" style="s2">Lock the door.</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.302" end="00:17:09.502" style="s2">No one comes in tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.202" end="00:17:14.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.902" end="00:17:15.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you come in?</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.202" end="00:17:17.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To see if you can get through this on</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.502" end="00:17:17.902" style="s2">your own.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.496" end="00:17:23.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.902" end="00:17:26.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t talk.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.302" end="00:17:26.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.047" end="00:17:28.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.802" end="00:17:33.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.102" end="00:17:41.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Twice.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.077" end="00:17:47.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.702" end="00:17:47.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three times.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.102" end="00:17:50.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.102" end="00:17:54.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our deal is over.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.902" end="00:17:56.502" style="s2">You can keep searching the archives</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.302" end="00:17:59.402" style="s2">without helping me, and you can leave</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.502" end="00:17:59.402" style="s2">whenever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.902" end="00:18:08.302" style="s2">This time the choice is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.702" end="00:18:12.302" style="s2">You didn&#39;t leave?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.002" end="00:18:18.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t come back for the deal.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.902" end="00:18:21.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what did you come back for?</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.502" end="00:18:21.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you another</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.703" end="00:18:26.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, it&#39;s only an opening</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.903" end="00:18:26.403" style="s2">dance.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.203" end="00:18:33.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one dance.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.203" end="00:18:36.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do I even care?</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.003" end="00:18:40.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me make it up to you with one</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.403" end="00:18:42.703" style="s2">dance.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.703" end="00:18:45.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this diplomatic protocol too?</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.703" end="00:18:45.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.003" end="00:18:50.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know court dances.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.888" end="00:18:52.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.203" end="00:18:56.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.503" end="00:18:57.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Courtesy for me, but his heart for her.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.203" end="00:18:59.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow we&#39;re settling the necklace</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.603" end="00:19:00.803" style="s2">once and for all.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.103" end="00:19:02.703" style="s2">If it truly belonged to my former</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.803" end="00:19:05.203" style="s2">mistress, the hidden compartment should</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.703" end="00:19:05.203" style="s2">open.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.703" end="00:19:09.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been too long. I forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.503" end="00:19:14.903" style="s2">That&#39;s the Queen. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.403" end="00:19:18.203" style="s2">Mother?</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.903" end="00:19:18.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will testify for her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.403" end="00:19:25.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both kingdoms need reinforcements.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.403" end="00:19:26.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop turning us back into a transaction.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.258" end="00:19:29.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.203" end="00:19:29.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it isn&#39;t one.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.103" end="00:19:38.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was this your choice too?</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.503" end="00:19:38.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.903" end="00:19:43.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you two doing?</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.103" end="00:19:47.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What you see is your answer.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.003" end="00:19:50.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is an agreement between two</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.303" end="00:19:52.003" style="s2">kingdoms.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.603" end="00:19:53.903" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to treat it like a private</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.003" end="00:19:55.903" style="s2">affair.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.903" end="00:19:59.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marriage is personal.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.903" end="00:19:59.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then answer the delegation tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.703" end="00:20:05.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to hear you reduce this marriage</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.903" end="00:20:05.703" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.103" end="00:20:11.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to make that decision</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.403" end="00:20:14.703" style="s2">because of me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.103" end="00:20:14.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t decide because of you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.203" end="00:20:18.803" style="s2">I &#39;ll decide for myself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.503" end="00:20:22.303" style="s2">You fastened it wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.803" end="00:20:25.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does your Majesty have nothing better to</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.105" end="00:20:29.005" style="s2">do today?</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.505" end="00:20:29.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were much bolder yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.605" end="00:20:35.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Aster de delegation requests your</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.305" end="00:20:35.705" style="s2">Majesty&#39;s answer today.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.005" end="00:20:41.105" style="s2">This is a matter of state. You decide.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.705" end="00:20:45.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kyle!</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.805" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already have.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.005" end="00:20:52.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you afraid of losing their</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.105" end="00:20:54.605" style="s2">reinforcements?</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.505" end="00:20:56.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we negotiate reinforcements as</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.605" end="00:20:57.605" style="s2">reinforcements.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.505" end="00:20:59.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re better at bargaining than I</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.605" end="00:21:01.805" style="s2">thought.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.105" end="00:21:05.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you understand now?</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.805" end="00:21:05.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You burned the marriage agreement?</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:10.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Record the exact date I refused to sign.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.505" end="00:21:16.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I really understand.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.605" end="00:21:22.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re keeping even the ashes?</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.505" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you&#39;re fighting Cassian, no detail</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.605" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">is too small.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.505" end="00:21:30.905" style="s2">I burned the life someone else tried to</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.205" end="00:21:30.905" style="s2">choose for me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.905" end="00:21:37.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty should see what she really</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.805" end="00:21:37.405" style="s2">wants.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.905" end="00:21:42.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once she regains her identity, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.605" end="00:21:45.705" style="s2">leave immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.705" end="00:21:45.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t write this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.805" end="00:21:51.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The handwriting is identical.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.305" end="00:21:55.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane?</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.905" end="00:21:59.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she wants to leave,</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.905" end="00:21:59.005" style="s2">she&#39;ll tell me herself.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.905" end="00:22:05.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty is judging this on emotion</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.305" end="00:22:05.905" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.605" end="00:22:11.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then compare it with the original.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.305" end="00:22:16.405" style="s2">The original has remained in the</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.105" end="00:22:16.405" style="s2">delegation&#39;s custody.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.105" end="00:22:22.805" style="s2">Did the forged letter copy this mistake</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.505" end="00:22:26.106" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.805" end="00:22:27.306" style="s2">This was traced from a copy of the</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.106" end="00:22:29.206" style="s2">petition.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.306" end="00:22:32.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t just prove I&#39;m innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.206" end="00:22:32.906" style="s2">Record who had access to the copy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.206" end="00:22:36.806" style="s2">The copy passed through his hands.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.406" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One servant&#39;s selfish act cannot</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.306" end="00:22:47.006" style="s2">implicate a minister.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.506" end="00:22:47.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then remember the path it took.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.406" end="00:22:52.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t try to win everything at once.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.606" end="00:22:55.206" style="s2">I told you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.506" end="00:22:55.206" style="s2">I trust her.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.206" end="00:23:01.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have I asked for money since I came to</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.806" end="00:23:03.106" style="s2">the palace? For land? A title?</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.106" end="00:23:06.606" style="s2">A marriage contract?</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.106" end="00:23:09.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want the king himself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.606" end="00:23:12.606" style="s2">And who is the one most desperate to</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.106" end="00:23:12.606" style="s2">marry her way into being queen?</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.806" end="00:23:18.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The question is whether your majesty is</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.906" end="00:23:21.606" style="s2">under her influence.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.806" end="00:23:21.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I am.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.606" end="00:23:30.606" style="s2">I care whether she&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.806" end="00:23:31.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So she can change your majesty&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.606" end="00:23:33.606" style="s2">decisions?</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.606" end="00:23:36.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caring about someone is not the same as</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.606" end="00:23:36.706" style="s2">losing judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.706" end="00:23:41.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t even have a family crest.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.606" end="00:23:45.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can resign this position whenever I</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.406" end="00:23:45.806" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.506" end="00:23:50.306" style="s2">I&#39;m not standing here because of a</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.806" end="00:23:50.306" style="s2">badge.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.006" end="00:23:56.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holding his majesty&#39;s hand doesn&#39;t make</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.906" end="00:23:56.706" style="s2">you a noble.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.906" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never said it did.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.506" end="00:24:03.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what gives you the right to stand</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.106" end="00:24:06.206" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.606" end="00:24:07.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The fact that I haven&#39;t lied.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.206" end="00:24:09.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She isn&#39;t even afraid of humiliation</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.906" end="00:24:11.106" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.406" end="00:24:13.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t turn her into another marriage</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.106" end="00:24:13.506" style="s2">close.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.606" end="00:24:20.006" style="s2">And she isn&#39;t here because I ordered her</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.406" end="00:24:20.006" style="s2">to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.006" end="00:24:25.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is ancestral law, not a measure</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.506" end="00:24:27.806" style="s2">against your majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.206" end="00:24:28.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve prepared very thoroughly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.806" end="00:24:33.207" style="s2">It would only prove</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.807" end="00:24:33.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Majesty can control it independently.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.908" end="00:24:37.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.908" end="00:24:41.307" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.207" end="00:24:41.307" style="s2">we break his condition together.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.707" end="00:24:46.207" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.107" end="00:24:46.207" style="s2">Stop it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.207" end="00:24:53.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Conscious and lucid, no one was harmed.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.807" end="00:24:59.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One day proves nothing about forever.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.007" end="00:25:06.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s results are witnessed by three</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.107" end="00:25:06.707" style="s2">ministers.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.107" end="00:25:11.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can touch me now.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.412" end="00:25:16.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.607" end="00:25:19.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve wanted to do this all day.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.507" end="00:25:19.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least you held out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.207" end="00:25:26.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty&#39;s eyes changed again.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.007" end="00:25:28.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move 100 guards from the west gate to</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.307" end="00:25:31.408" style="s2">the northern pass.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.707" end="00:25:31.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you command.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.908" end="00:25:38.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not just enduring it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.707" end="00:25:38.507" style="s2">You&#39;re still ruling.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.107" end="00:25:43.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what Cassian doesn&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.107" end="00:25:43.807" style="s2">them to see.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.107" end="00:25:54.408" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll use a force he can&#39;t suppress</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.807" end="00:25:54.408" style="s2">on his own.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.908" end="00:26:01.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only write what we can prove.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.307" end="00:26:01.107" style="s2">No guesses.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.408" end="00:26:06.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time it goes directly into the</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.207" end="00:26:06.807" style="s2">royal verification record.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.207" end="00:26:13.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Bloodstone&#39;s final restoration is</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.807" end="00:26:14.607" style="s2">complete.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.207" end="00:26:17.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When can it be used again?</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.607" end="00:26:20.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No later than the winter royal council.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.107" end="00:26:20.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll submit to every verification.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.107" end="00:26:28.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So will I.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.408" end="00:26:28.807" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll wait for the result together.</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.707" end="00:26:32.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said they&#39;d never be able to test</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.609" end="00:26:37.109" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.909" end="00:26:38.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never is a word for cowards.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.109" end="00:26:40.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already knew.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.609" end="00:26:43.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay on my side</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.309" end="00:26:44.709" style="s2">and I can protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.109" end="00:26:47.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you protecting me</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.709" end="00:26:50.709" style="s2">or the seal?</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.109" end="00:26:50.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t ask useless questions.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.109" end="00:26:56.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He never believed I was the princess.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.109" end="00:27:04.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.409" end="00:27:04.209" style="s2">one document will not decide everything.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.909" end="00:27:10.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let the truth exist in only one</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.509" end="00:27:13.609" style="s2">person&#39;s hands again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.909" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We made that mistake once 15 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.609" end="00:27:16.809" style="s2">We won&#39;t make it twice.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.909" end="00:27:22.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He only needs me to look like a</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.009" end="00:27:22.609" style="s2">princess.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.109" end="00:27:27.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As soon as the bloodstone is ready</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.809" end="00:27:31.209" style="s2">you&#39;ll be tested.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.309" end="00:27:32.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time I want an official answer.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.209" end="00:27:34.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A maid cannot sit in the king&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.609" end="00:27:37.409" style="s2">companion seat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.209" end="00:27:39.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rules are rules.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.409" end="00:27:41.509" style="s2">I&#39;m here to deliver medicine, not steal</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.109" end="00:27:41.509" style="s2">a chair.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.109" end="00:27:47.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May she enter now?</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.409" end="00:27:47.009" style="s2">Please enter.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.209" end="00:27:54.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the king&#39;s companion seat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.509" end="00:27:56.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a seat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.809" end="00:27:59.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The thing that truly decides my identity</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.509" end="00:28:02.709" style="s2">will soon be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.309" end="00:28:03.909" style="s2">Feeling pleased with yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.709" end="00:28:05.509" style="s2">I simply don&#39;t need to wait for your</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.909" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">approval anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.509" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Write down the reason clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.809" end="00:28:14.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the verification fails</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.209" end="00:28:15.709" style="s2">will you still stay?</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.709" end="00:28:17.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That would only prove I&#39;m not a</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.709" end="00:28:20.709" style="s2">princess.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.309" end="00:28:20.709" style="s2">It wouldn&#39;t make me anyone&#39;s possession.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.309" end="00:28:26.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better than most ministers would answer.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.309" end="00:28:29.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The result won&#39;t fail.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.309" end="00:28:32.609" style="s2">Then you should be even more eager to</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.909" end="00:28:34.209" style="s2">see the bloodstone than I am.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.609" end="00:28:36.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least this time</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.209" end="00:28:39.710" style="s2">neither of us is above the other, and I</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.210" end="00:28:41.710" style="s2">won&#39;t hide behind this cloak either.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.710" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s only to prevent further</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.710" end="00:28:44.610" style="s2">accusations.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.810" end="00:28:50.610" style="s2">You people do enjoy deciding who may</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.010" end="00:28:53.010" style="s2">enter my rooms.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.610" end="00:28:54.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept a temporary separation.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.010" end="00:28:57.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re always making things easier for</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.810" end="00:28:57.710" style="s2">everyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.110" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, we find out what&#39;s wrong with the</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.510" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">medicine and the underground markings.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.010" end="00:29:10.710" style="s2">Palace rules forbid me from entering</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.610" end="00:29:12.210" style="s2">your room.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.710" end="00:29:14.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They don&#39;t forbid me from entering</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.210" end="00:29:14.810" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.010" end="00:29:23.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that just exploiting a loophole?</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.510" end="00:29:26.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight, no identities and no curse.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.910" end="00:29:26.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we talk about?</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.010" end="00:29:31.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why you keep coming back when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.310" end="00:29:34.110" style="s2">free to leave?</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.910" end="00:29:35.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you really need an answer?</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.110" end="00:29:36.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can come in</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.510" end="00:29:38.510" style="s2">and you can make me leave whenever you</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.910" end="00:29:40.810" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.510" end="00:29:42.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always leave me a way out.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.810" end="00:29:44.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I hate anyone deciding what</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.410" end="00:29:46.210" style="s2">happens to my body.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.610" end="00:29:49.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then neither of us should ever become</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.210" end="00:29:49.210" style="s2">that kind of person.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.310" end="00:29:53.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty really didn&#39;t let her into</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.210" end="00:29:53.910" style="s2">his chambers.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.510" end="00:30:01.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, something&#39;s happening to</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.310" end="00:30:04.810" style="s2">the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.110" end="00:30:04.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t take any medicine at all.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.200" end="00:30:09.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.210" end="00:30:09.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not the medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.310" end="00:30:13.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, evacuate this floor.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.710" end="00:30:20.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s glowing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.410" end="00:30:25.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The source</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.410" end="00:30:29.310" style="s2">is beneath the palace.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.910" end="00:30:29.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going to the old stone chamber.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.510" end="00:30:36.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll clear the way for you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.310" end="00:30:36.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seal the east corridor. No one comes</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.312" end="00:30:43.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t follow me inside.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.012" end="00:30:43.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll stay outside the door.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:47.612" style="s2">Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.912" end="00:30:55.636" style="s2">Look ahead. Run to the stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.312" end="00:30:57.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one&#39;s in the way now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.636" end="00:30:59.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.212" end="00:31:01.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, we evacuate innocent people</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.412" end="00:31:04.612" style="s2">first every time.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.812" end="00:31:07.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Investigate only this line.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.612" end="00:31:07.712" style="s2">Don&#39;t spread the search.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.812" end="00:31:11.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take my sword.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.712" end="00:31:16.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need a weapon to force you back</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.212" end="00:31:16.912" style="s2">to yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.512" end="00:31:23.712" style="s2">Someone below is pushing him into an</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.212" end="00:31:23.712" style="s2">episode.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.112" end="00:31:30.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The council must know the king&#39;s current</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.912" end="00:31:32.812" style="s2">condition.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.712" end="00:31:34.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty ordered everyone to clear</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.812" end="00:31:37.412" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.412" end="00:31:38.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.412" end="00:31:40.612" style="s2">Dear God.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.712" end="00:31:42.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.612" end="00:31:44.912" style="s2">I don&#39;t want anyone later claiming they</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.012" end="00:31:44.912" style="s2">never saw this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.112" end="00:31:51.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cael, stop here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.712" end="00:31:56.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELARA, GET BACK. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.012" end="00:32:05.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHO I AM.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.912" end="00:32:09.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STILL not enough.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.312" end="00:32:16.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s saving her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.712" end="00:32:22.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone tampered with it from the</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.912" end="00:32:22.512" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.812" end="00:32:31.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This door did not open by itself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.912" end="00:32:31.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, ENSURE EVERYONE&#39;S SAFETY.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.112" end="00:32:36.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can argue about the evidence later.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.612" end="00:32:36.612" style="s2">No one gets hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.112" end="00:32:41.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone behind the second row of</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.713" end="00:32:41.213" style="s2">pillars.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.513" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did he warn me in advance?</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.213" end="00:32:53.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Close the door.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.013" end="00:33:00.742" style="s2">Lower your bows. If the king lunges at</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.313" end="00:33:01.613" style="s2">someone, we must protect the people.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.742" end="00:33:04.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.613" end="00:33:06.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He just saved Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.672" end="00:33:09.213" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.113" end="00:33:09.213" style="s2">He really didn&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.613" end="00:33:15.713" style="s2">Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.113" end="00:33:15.713" style="s2">We&#39;re leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.413" end="00:33:21.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He understands us.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.713" end="00:33:23.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A monster stopping itself doesn&#39;t mean a</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.513" end="00:33:25.213" style="s2">king can rule.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.113" end="00:33:28.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve waited all this time for him to</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.213" end="00:33:28.113" style="s2">hurt someone.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.253" end="00:33:32.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.613" end="00:33:32.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His majesty knows who&#39;s forcing him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.713" end="00:33:36.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew the door would open?</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.513" end="00:33:37.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only know the kingdom needs to be</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.913" end="00:33:41.313" style="s2">safe.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.913" end="00:33:42.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even now he still understands distance.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.313" end="00:33:46.013" style="s2">You saw it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.913" end="00:33:46.013" style="s2">He still has a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.113" end="00:33:53.313" style="s2">You didn&#39;t even ask if I was hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.713" end="00:33:54.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re standing just fried, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.313" end="00:33:56.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.713" end="00:33:58.613" style="s2">Then why are you never the one who gets</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.313" end="00:33:58.613" style="s2">hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.513" end="00:34:05.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you need a sedative?</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.013" end="00:34:05.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.713" end="00:34:12.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m back.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.313" end="00:34:15.713" style="s2">Your arm.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.413" end="00:34:15.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It didn&#39;t even break the skin.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.113" end="00:34:22.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time you may not be this lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.013" end="00:34:27.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time I decide whether I stand close</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.113" end="00:34:28.513" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.013" end="00:34:30.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to stay away from you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.513" end="00:34:30.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.113" end="00:34:37.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why keep this?</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.813" end="00:34:45.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If If says he lost his mind, this is</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.414" end="00:34:45.414" style="s2">evidence that he didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.814" end="00:34:54.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Facts are more useful than comfort.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.114" end="00:34:57.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When he&#39;s ready to come out, then I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.714" end="00:34:57.514" style="s2">argue with him.</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.614" end="00:35:03.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, that&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.014" end="00:35:03.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.314" end="00:35:09.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.614" end="00:35:13.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I almost hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.614" end="00:35:13.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is what you call almost?</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.914" end="00:35:18.214" style="s2">You stopped and you saved Serena.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.514" end="00:35:25.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time I might not stop.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.714" end="00:35:25.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The next time we face it together.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.914" end="00:35:33.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I came at a bad time.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.514" end="00:35:35.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He saved me last night, too.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.214" end="00:35:36.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.214" end="00:35:38.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I agreed to have the identity</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.614" end="00:35:40.014" style="s2">verification done as soon as possible.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.814" end="00:35:41.214" style="s2">This time I&#39;ll go myself.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.014" end="00:35:43.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Showing up doesn&#39;t mean you&#39;ll tell the</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.214" end="00:35:44.714" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.414" end="00:35:46.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least I&#39;m starting to want to know</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.714" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">what the truth is.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.514" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The answer is coming soon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.914" end="00:35:58.014" style="s2">What I remember is that I stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.914" end="00:35:58.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re finally not afraid to</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.014" end="00:36:01.114" style="s2">investigate?</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.914" end="00:36:03.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today we&#39;re not chasing suspects. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.114" end="00:36:04.314" style="s2">only watching the reactions.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.014" end="00:36:07.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The normal medicine shows no</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.314" end="00:36:07.114" style="s2">abnormality.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.814" end="00:36:14.014" style="s2">At most that proves someone tampered</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.514" end="00:36:16.614" style="s2">with the medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.014" end="00:36:18.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about now?</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.614" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The medicine and whatever is underground</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.314" end="00:36:23.214" style="s2">are the same kind of power.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.514" end="00:36:25.114" style="s2">The crystal shard only resonates when</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:27.614" style="s2">triggered by contaminated medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.114" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The medicine is only the trigger.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.614" end="00:36:31.514" style="s2">The underground source keeps it going.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.614" end="00:36:35.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know what&#39;s beneath the palace?</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.614" end="00:36:39.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are many ruins beneath the old</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.314" end="00:36:41.314" style="s2">palace.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.514" end="00:36:42.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seal the entrance to the Obsidian Main</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.314" end="00:36:45.716" style="s2">Main.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.614" end="00:36:45.716" style="s2">No one is touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.616" end="00:36:50.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.216" end="00:36:52.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What right does a maid have to keep the</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.316" end="00:36:54.216" style="s2">king&#39;s medicine?</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.116" end="00:36:55.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every sample was lawfully sealed as</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.216" end="00:36:58.316" style="s2">evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.116" end="00:37:02.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every record is complete.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.316" end="00:37:04.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not afraid the evidence is false.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.316" end="00:37:06.416" style="s2">You&#39;re afraid it&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.916" end="00:37:08.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on,</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.416" end="00:37:10.516" style="s2">no one gets another chance to do what</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.316" end="00:37:14.416" style="s2">Cassian did.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.516" end="00:37:14.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The real source is beneath the palace.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.516" end="00:37:21.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That still doesn&#39;t prove she&#39;s innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.016" end="00:37:23.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t find a scapegoat, so now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.716" end="00:37:25.016" style="s2">accusing me directly?</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.116" end="00:37:25.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are all these things in your</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.016" end="00:37:28.916" style="s2">possession?</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.816" end="00:37:32.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I preserved the evidence you</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.916" end="00:37:32.316" style="s2">wanted destroyed.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.816" end="00:37:37.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If both sides insist they&#39;re right, then</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.616" end="00:37:38.816" style="s2">let there be a public hearing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.516" end="00:37:40.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can dismiss the charge.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.816" end="00:37:41.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.116" end="00:37:44.316" style="s2">You can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.316" end="00:37:44.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You understand trial?</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.416" end="00:37:50.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you suppress the case for me,</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.316" end="00:37:52.416" style="s2">it&#39;ll look like I&#39;m controlling you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.316" end="00:37:54.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let her face the hearing.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.416" end="00:37:56.616" style="s2">If a single hair on her head is harmed,</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.916" end="00:37:59.116" style="s2">you&#39;ll answer for it first.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.616" end="00:38:01.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The more your majesty protects her,</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.116" end="00:38:03.716" style="s2">the more the nobles will ask why.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.716" end="00:38:08.116" style="s2">If she says she&#39;s innocent,</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.716" end="00:38:08.116" style="s2">let everyone hear her case.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.316" end="00:38:13.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.216" end="00:38:13.116" style="s2">Then you can&#39;t change your story later.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.016" end="00:38:18.916" style="s2">No one gets to rewrite what happens</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.716" end="00:38:18.916" style="s2">today after the fact.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.816" end="00:38:27.716" style="s2">Let them ask. I&#39;ll answer.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.716" end="00:38:31.616" style="s2">I &#39;ll go in myself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.916" end="00:38:36.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can withdraw the charge.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.816" end="00:38:39.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you force the case closed, Cassian</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.516" end="00:38:39.616" style="s2">will say I&#39;m controlling you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.016" end="00:38:46.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hate this decision.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.216" end="00:38:46.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can fight about it after I get out.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.017" end="00:38:50.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you asleep?</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.517" end="00:38:53.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.917" end="00:38:55.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never hated obeying the rules this</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.017" end="00:38:55.517" style="s2">much.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.617" end="00:38:59.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That only proves you still know rules</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.217" end="00:39:01.817" style="s2">rules matter.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.917" end="00:39:03.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t just give this to someone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.817" end="00:39:05.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If something happens tomorrow, use it to</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.317" end="00:39:08.417" style="s2">evacuate people and protect them. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.017" end="00:39:09.917" style="s2">giving you a way out, not a free pass.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.417" end="00:39:12.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.917" end="00:39:15.117" style="s2">I&#39;m the first witness.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.817" end="00:39:17.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell them what you truly know.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.117" end="00:39:18.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really think the truth will save</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.017" end="00:39:19.617" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.017" end="00:39:22.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if the bloodstone proves tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.617" end="00:39:22.717" style="s2">that I&#39;m really the heir?</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.917" end="00:39:25.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;ll have another kingdom to</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.117" end="00:39:26.917" style="s2">face.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.717" end="00:39:28.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it?</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.917" end="00:39:30.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.817" end="00:39:32.017" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t mean I have the right to</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.117" end="00:39:33.817" style="s2">make you stay.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.017" end="00:39:37.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She may stand trial, but no one is to</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.817" end="00:39:37.117" style="s2">torment her deliberately.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:41.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least I won&#39;t live for a lie anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.917" end="00:39:48.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She secretly kept the king&#39;s medicine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.617" end="00:39:48.717" style="s2">That is a fact.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.917" end="00:39:53.917" style="s2">And deliberate curse stimulation is also</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.217" end="00:39:55.317" style="s2">a fact.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.917" end="00:39:56.617" style="s2">What right does someone with no birth</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.317" end="00:39:58.217" style="s2">record have to get this close to the</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.617" end="00:40:01.717" style="s2">king?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.217" end="00:40:01.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can&#39;t even prove who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.617" end="00:40:08.117" style="s2">Which is why I requested formal</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.017" end="00:40:11.717" style="s2">verification myself.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.117" end="00:40:11.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The verification is approved.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.817" end="00:40:17.317" style="s2">The royal blood star is restored and</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.917" end="00:40:20.217" style="s2">ready for use.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.317" end="00:40:20.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it early?</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.117" end="00:40:26.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The restoration is complete.</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.117" end="00:40:26.417" style="s2">There is no reason to delay.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.517" end="00:40:30.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go prove who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.117" end="00:40:33.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These two matters cannot be mixed</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.717" end="00:40:33.217" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.417" end="00:40:40.617" style="s2">Precisely because identity affects this</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.517" end="00:40:43.217" style="s2">hearing, it must be verified first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.617" end="00:40:45.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First prove who I am, then continue</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.217" end="00:40:46.717" style="s2">judging what I&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.317" end="00:40:49.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re less afraid of judgment than any</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.717" end="00:40:49.117" style="s2">of them.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.317" end="00:40:52.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve waited 15 years for this.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.518" end="00:40:57.018" style="s2">This time no one speaks for me. The</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.318" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">political situation in both kingdoms is</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.018" end="00:41:00.318" style="s2">unstable. The verification should be</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:02.718" style="s2">postponed.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.318" end="00:41:05.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The verification order was gently signed</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.718" end="00:41:07.018" style="s2">by the old royal ministers.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.318" end="00:41:11.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From this point on,</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.018" end="00:41:11.018" style="s2">I rely only on my own evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.718" end="00:41:15.918" style="s2">If it&#39;s true,</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.018" end="00:41:15.918" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to go back.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.718" end="00:41:23.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to go back, go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.618" end="00:41:23.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going to ask me to stay.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.618" end="00:41:29.918" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll come [clears throat] back on</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.518" end="00:41:29.918" style="s2">my own.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.118" end="00:41:36.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, please proceed to the</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.918" end="00:41:38.618" style="s2">verification hall.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.818" end="00:41:39.618" style="s2">Until the result is official, call me</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.618" end="00:41:43.018" style="s2">Elara.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.618" end="00:41:43.018" style="s2">Your Highness still wants to keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.418" end="00:41:46.918" style="s2">It&#39;s proof of the life I survived.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.318" end="00:41:52.018" style="s2">This part of the road</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.518" end="00:41:53.518" style="s2">I walk by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.018" end="00:41:54.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll wait for you outside at the end.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.518" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">Now, you finally look like you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.918" end="00:41:58.418" style="s2">wearing something you chose for</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:58.418" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.418" end="00:42:03.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inside that door,</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.918" end="00:42:05.918" style="s2">you don&#39;t need the King of Lasea to</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.318" end="00:42:05.918" style="s2">speak for you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.018" end="00:42:12.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both claimants, please enter.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.918" end="00:42:18.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the past, relics could only establish</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.818" end="00:42:21.718" style="s2">a provisional contender.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.718" end="00:42:21.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have all the relics.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.618" end="00:42:29.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please continue.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.018" end="00:42:31.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I had a high fever as a child. I forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.818" end="00:42:32.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hidden compartment contains more</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.218" end="00:42:33.518" style="s2">than decoration.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.118" end="00:42:35.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Continue.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.518" end="00:42:38.118" style="s2">If you back down now,</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.418" end="00:42:38.118" style="s2">you&#39;ll have nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.218" end="00:42:43.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew I couldn&#39;t open it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.418" end="00:42:43.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; only know who is useful to me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.918" end="00:42:47.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.818" end="00:42:49.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The design, engraved name, and workshop</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.018" end="00:42:51.420" style="s2">seal all match.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.018" end="00:42:54.720" style="s2">The young princess had a crescent-shaped</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.420" end="00:42:54.720" style="s2">on her right collarbone.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.520" end="00:42:59.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just remember the wrong side.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.520" end="00:43:10.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are only supporting details.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.020" end="00:43:16.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the final test can determine the</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.720" end="00:43:18.020" style="s2">blood line.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.320" end="00:43:20.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one is forcing you to keep giving</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.020" end="00:43:21.690" style="s2">wrong answers.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.220" end="00:43:23.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I&#39;ve already gone too far.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.690" end="00:43:23.710" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.420" end="00:43:31.020" style="s2">So I was never the missing child.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.120" end="00:43:33.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Final test.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.020" end="00:43:35.500" style="s2">Direct blood line.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.480" end="00:43:35.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.420" end="00:43:43.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is not the princess. The child I</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.120" end="00:43:43.320" style="s2">found was Serena. She was wearing this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.020" end="00:43:48.120" style="s2">That&#39;s my clothing, not her birth</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.420" end="00:43:51.720" style="s2">certificate.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.120" end="00:43:53.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I raised you for 15 years and you dare</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.720" end="00:43:55.420" style="s2">SPEAK TO ME LIKE THIS?</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.720" end="00:43:57.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You raised me so I could serve your</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.420" end="00:43:59.020" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.020" end="00:44:02.420" style="s2">Then when you realized I was valuable,</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.020" end="00:44:04.120" style="s2">you sold my identity TO HER.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.420" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE LYING.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.120" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHE WAS BORN IN GRAYVILLE.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.820" end="00:44:15.320" style="s2">I have a local birth record.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.720" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did all of this for you. Stop talking.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.320" end="00:44:19.120" style="s2">I want the truth. Serena, I was</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.820" end="00:44:22.420" style="s2">protecting you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.120" end="00:44:22.420" style="s2">You knew from the beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.920" end="00:44:28.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She doesn&#39;t need to say it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.520" end="00:44:28.520" style="s2">The blood will prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.740" end="00:44:37.120" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.820" end="00:44:38.520" style="s2">You&#39;re not afraid I&#39;m lying.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:40.920" style="s2">You&#39;re afraid the records won&#39;t lie for</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.520" end="00:44:43.920" style="s2">you. This time</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.920" end="00:44:43.920" style="s2">let the blood speak.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.620" end="00:44:53.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Direct blood line confirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.020" end="00:44:53.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.520" end="00:45:01.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Royal Ring is responding too.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.821" end="00:45:04.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the ancient warding covenant</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.321" end="00:45:04.521" style="s2">from centuries ago.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.921" end="00:45:10.621" style="s2">The first king broke the covenant and</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.221" end="00:45:10.621" style="s2">the witch cursed the throne.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.721" end="00:45:16.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So whoever is crowned inherits the</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.621" end="00:45:16.221" style="s2">curse.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.421" end="00:45:22.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As his ancestors could only seal it with</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.521" end="00:45:23.921" style="s2">the bloodstone,</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.121" end="00:45:25.921" style="s2">they could not break it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.921" end="00:45:28.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My blood can only restore his awareness</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.921" end="00:45:30.221" style="s2">and open the seal.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.421" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To truly break it, the one who bears the</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.221" end="00:45:33.621" style="s2">curse must do it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.321" end="00:45:38.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those aren&#39;t our people closing the</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.421" end="00:45:38.821" style="s2">doors.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.721" end="00:45:44.521" style="s2">It&#39;s too late to talk about the throne</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.221" end="00:45:44.521" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.121" end="00:45:50.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never signed that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.021" end="00:46:00.521" style="s2">Get the true princess&#39;s result out</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.521" end="00:46:02.321" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.521" end="00:46:04.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if the palace falls, the identity</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.321" end="00:46:08.621" style="s2">result cannot be erased.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.921" end="00:46:10.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He isn&#39;t afraid I&#39;ll lose my status.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.621" end="00:46:12.921" style="s2">He&#39;s afraid my false steel will become</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.421" end="00:46:12.921" style="s2">useless.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.721" end="00:46:18.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little late to realize that now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.221" end="00:46:20.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First we survive,</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.721" end="00:46:21.921" style="s2">then we take the palace back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.721" end="00:46:24.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now,</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.921" end="00:46:26.621" style="s2">who still dares call him king?</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.121" end="00:46:29.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Regency order is now in effect. Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.621" end="00:46:31.321" style="s2">remain where you are.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.521" end="00:46:32.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone loyal to the crown, evacuate the</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.321" end="00:46:34.321" style="s2">civilians first.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.521" end="00:46:36.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By his majesty&#39;s standing order, OPEN</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.321" end="00:46:37.421" style="s2">THE SIDE GATES.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.121" end="00:46:39.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUR HIGHNESS, we will follow your</p>
<p begin="00:46:37.421" end="00:46:42.721" style="s2">command.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.721" end="00:46:42.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, get them out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.321" end="00:46:45.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.821" end="00:46:51.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s make sure he can&#39;t hold out</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.021" end="00:46:51.821" style="s2">much longer.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.521" end="00:46:59.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His majesty has shifted.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.723" end="00:47:03.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Secure the exit first.</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.823" end="00:47:03.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s starting to act like a ruler.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.723" end="00:47:08.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY ENTIRE FORTUNE IS IN THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.523" end="00:47:10.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IF YOU&#39;RE DEAD, WHAT exactly</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.632" end="00:47:13.122" style="s2">[clears throat] are you planning to</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.422" end="00:47:13.122" style="s2">protect it with?</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.523" end="00:47:17.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s actually giving orders.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.523" end="00:47:24.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half the side passage is clear.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.023" end="00:47:26.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Civilians first. We take the gate after</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.122" end="00:47:26.723" style="s2">they&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.122" end="00:47:34.323" style="s2">One door is not enough for an evacuation</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.023" end="00:47:34.323" style="s2">route.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.723" end="00:47:46.723" style="s2">Now we go bring the other king back.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.622" end="00:47:46.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at him. THIS IS YOUR KING.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.622" end="00:47:53.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.723" end="00:47:55.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty is isolating himself.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.422" end="00:47:58.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A monster&#39;s instincts do not prove he</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.723" end="00:48:00.023" style="s2">can rule. Admit it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:58.023" end="00:48:01.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is your seal.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.023" end="00:48:02.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The seal is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.723" end="00:48:05.122" style="s2">The words are not.</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.922" end="00:48:05.963" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to lose your status as the</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.122" end="00:48:06.122" style="s2">heir?</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.963" end="00:48:08.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.122" end="00:48:10.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to see the original.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.823" end="00:48:12.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You only need to answer.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.323" end="00:48:15.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tsarina, stop letting other people</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.622" end="00:48:15.422" style="s2">choose for you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.723" end="00:48:19.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Record this. The beast form king</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.023" end="00:48:21.422" style="s2">approached the heir with intent to</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.922" end="00:48:22.723" style="s2">attack.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.422" end="00:48:23.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But his Majesty just saved that</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.723" end="00:48:27.023" style="s2">attendant.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.422" end="00:48:27.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Write only what I tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.823" end="00:48:32.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep both records.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.523" end="00:48:32.723" style="s2">Let people compare them later.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.922" end="00:48:35.422" style="s2">Recorded.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.122" end="00:48:39.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are very good at stealing the</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.523" end="00:48:40.723" style="s2">narrative.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.323" end="00:48:43.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only stopping you from stealing the</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.723" end="00:48:43.323" style="s2">facts.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.723" end="00:48:49.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty is clearing dangerous</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.223" end="00:48:49.422" style="s2">objects away from himself.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.922" end="00:48:54.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.523" end="00:48:54.323" style="s2">Let me think.</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.422" end="00:49:00.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still making his curse worse?</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.323" end="00:49:02.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need him to lose control.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.124" end="00:49:04.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never cared whether he actually went</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.524" end="00:49:06.124" style="s2">mad.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.024" end="00:49:08.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only need everyone else to believe he</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.124" end="00:49:08.324" style="s2">did.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.224" end="00:49:14.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.324" end="00:49:16.724" style="s2">You are not his evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.724" end="00:49:18.324" style="s2">Neither am I.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.724" end="00:49:19.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.324" end="00:49:23.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t write it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.924" end="00:49:23.624" style="s2">And I won&#39;t acknowledge a single word.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.124" end="00:49:27.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to lose everything just like</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.124" end="00:49:28.724" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.224" end="00:49:31.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hunt,</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.724" end="00:49:31.524" style="s2">the medicine,</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.324" end="00:49:36.024" style="s2">the stone chamber, that was all you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.824" end="00:49:39.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without me, you couldn&#39;t even keep</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.024" end="00:49:39.524" style="s2">pretending to be a princess.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.824" end="00:49:43.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I won&#39;t pretend anymore. If you</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.524" end="00:49:46.124" style="s2">want to make amends, help us shut down</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.324" end="00:49:46.124" style="s2">the main vein first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.024" end="00:49:49.924" style="s2">Tell me where the entrance is. This</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.324" end="00:49:51.824" style="s2">paper cannot save me.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.924" end="00:49:53.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without confirmation from the allied uh</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.824" end="00:49:56.224" style="s2">the third condition IS INVALID.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.424" end="00:49:56.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP!</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.524" end="00:50:03.024" style="s2">WHAT I STOLE NEVER BELONGED TO ME IN THE</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.324" end="00:50:03.024" style="s2">FIRST PLACE.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.424" end="00:50:06.324" style="s2">This isn&#39;t mine either.</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:09.624" style="s2">You know giving it back doesn&#39;t erase</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.324" end="00:50:11.924" style="s2">what you did.</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.624" end="00:50:11.924" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.924" end="00:50:17.424" style="s2">15 years.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.524" end="00:50:19.124" style="s2">It&#39;s finally back.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.424" end="00:50:22.024" style="s2">These were sent to me before his worst</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.124" end="00:50:24.124" style="s2">episodes even happened.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.024" end="00:50:26.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knew in advance that his majesty</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.124" end="00:50:28.824" style="s2">would lose control.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.324" end="00:50:28.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seize him!</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.624" end="00:50:33.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even now he&#39;s still protecting us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.124" end="00:50:39.424" style="s2">I owe him.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.424" end="00:50:41.724" style="s2">Today I&#39;ll repay at least one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.424" end="00:50:43.324" style="s2">The ledgers and seals may be in there.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.724" end="00:50:45.824" style="s2">Hold this position. I&#39;m going for the</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.324" end="00:50:48.124" style="s2">evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.824" end="00:50:48.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SERENA!</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.924" end="00:50:53.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KALE COMES FIRST.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.624" end="00:50:57.824" style="s2">I&#39;LL KEEP IT SAFE.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:51:01.024" style="s2">YOU finally got it back and you aren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.824" end="00:51:01.024" style="s2">even rushing to wear it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.824" end="00:51:05.225" style="s2">It&#39;s important.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.324" end="00:51:07.725" style="s2">It just isn&#39;t the most important thing</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.225" end="00:51:07.725" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.925" end="00:51:13.525" style="s2">No wonder I stole the necklace and still</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.625" end="00:51:15.925" style="s2">never became you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.525" end="00:51:18.725" style="s2">Stop calling me your highness.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.925" end="00:51:18.725" style="s2">That isn&#39;t my name.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.625" end="00:51:25.525" style="s2">The chains are amplifying the curse too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.725" end="00:51:29.525" style="s2">Take me to your study.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.425" end="00:51:40.025" style="s2">He never let me touch anything in the</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.025" end="00:51:40.025" style="s2">inmost compartment.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.625" end="00:51:45.425" style="s2">Now it all connects.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.225" end="00:51:47.225" style="s2">He even recorded the dates I lent him my</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.425" end="00:51:48.625" style="s2">seal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.225" end="00:51:49.825" style="s2">That&#39;s enough. We don&#39;t have time to</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.625" end="00:51:53.625" style="s2">waste.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.825" end="00:51:53.625" style="s2">Why is Astic&#39;s crest carved here?</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.925" end="00:51:57.925" style="s2">Cassian didn&#39;t stumble onto the main</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.525" end="00:52:00.025" style="s2">vein by accident.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.925" end="00:52:01.725" style="s2">Go. I&#39;ll hold them off for a while.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.025" end="00:52:05.125" style="s2">Don&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.725" end="00:52:05.125" style="s2">You still owe yourself a trial.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.225" end="00:52:11.125" style="s2">He prepared the crystals first, then</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.625" end="00:52:13.125" style="s2">waited for his majesty to lose control.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.125" end="00:52:15.525" style="s2">Even the royal physician&#39;s statement was</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.125" end="00:52:17.825" style="s2">bought.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.525" end="00:52:19.925" style="s2">We each take one copy. If one of us is</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.825" end="00:52:21.225" style="s2">caught, we don&#39;t lose everything.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.925" end="00:52:23.525" style="s2">You&#39;re still willing to trust me with</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.225" end="00:52:25.346" style="s2">evidence? I&#39;m not trusting you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.525" end="00:52:27.366" style="s2">We need two ways out.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.346" end="00:52:27.366" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.625" end="00:52:35.425" style="s2">No one has ever told me to stay alive</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.225" end="00:52:37.025" style="s2">so I could repay what I owe.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.425" end="00:52:39.325" style="s2">So this is where all the missing pieces</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.025" end="00:52:39.325" style="s2">were.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.825" end="00:52:43.225" style="s2">The first king made a pact with the</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.525" end="00:52:45.225" style="s2">obsidian witch.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.225" end="00:52:47.125" style="s2">The king broke the pact. That&#39;s why the</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.225" end="00:52:49.325" style="s2">curse fell on the throne. The curse is</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.125" end="00:52:50.925" style="s2">tied to the throne, not the bloodline.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.325" end="00:52:52.725" style="s2">Whoever takes the throne inherits the</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.925" end="00:52:54.525" style="s2">curse.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.725" end="00:52:56.425" style="s2">Aster royal blood can only open the</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.525" end="00:52:58.125" style="s2">seal.</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.425" end="00:53:00.825" style="s2">The only person who can truly end the</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.125" end="00:53:02.625" style="s2">curse is Cael.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.825" end="00:53:06.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open the door.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.625" end="00:53:06.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t be the one who remembers this.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.921" end="00:53:10.927" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.727" end="00:53:12.227" style="s2">The main vein follows the crown ruler.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.927" end="00:53:14.027" style="s2">Cael isn&#39;t suffering this because of</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.227" end="00:53:15.627" style="s2">something he did. It&#39;s because he took</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.027" end="00:53:16.927" style="s2">the throne. Only when the cursed one</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.627" end="00:53:18.727" style="s2">tears out the root himself will the</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.927" end="00:53:21.127" style="s2">curse truly end.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.727" end="00:53:22.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Break it open.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.127" end="00:53:23.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found the answer.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.627" end="00:53:26.227" style="s2">Cassian didn&#39;t find this place by</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.827" end="00:53:27.627" style="s2">accident.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.227" end="00:53:29.427" style="s2">He&#39;s been using this place to manipulate</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.627" end="00:53:31.927" style="s2">the main vein. I&#39;m taking the method</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.427" end="00:53:31.927" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.927" end="00:53:36.427" style="s2">But I&#39;m not giving them the altar.</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.627" end="00:53:41.927" style="s2">Cael.</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.527" end="00:53:46.327" style="s2">Knowing how to end it doesn&#39;t mean we&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.127" end="00:53:47.827" style="s2">won.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.327" end="00:53:49.527" style="s2">First I have to get you out of Cassian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.827" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">hands.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.527" end="00:53:53.327" style="s2">This time</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.927" end="00:53:55.327" style="s2">I can&#39;t keep suppressing it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.327" end="00:53:58.827" style="s2">I can open that door for you, but I have</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.327" end="00:53:58.827" style="s2">to believe you can walk out on your own.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.127" end="00:54:03.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back again to touch him and save the</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.727" end="00:54:06.327" style="s2">day?</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.227" end="00:54:06.327" style="s2">Your Highness, don&#39;t go in.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.927" end="00:54:11.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.827" end="00:54:11.827" style="s2">I won&#39;t touch you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.027" end="00:54:15.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you see?</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.127" end="00:54:18.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know who I am.</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.727" end="00:54:20.727" style="s2">And you know who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.727" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KILL HER! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.727" end="00:54:24.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T PROVE anything for him.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.227" end="00:54:29.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty is attacking the main vein.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.427" end="00:54:37.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.827" end="00:54:39.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; PIN HIM DOWN. PIN HIM DOWN.</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.127" end="00:54:40.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EVERY time you wait for him to lose</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.427" end="00:54:45.127" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.327" end="00:54:45.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because sooner or later he will.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.127" end="00:54:49.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he&#39;ll make sure your moment never</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.627" end="00:54:50.757" style="s2">comes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.327" end="00:54:51.927" style="s2">Cael.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.757" end="00:54:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.927" end="00:54:55.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty is tracing the control back</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.427" end="00:54:59.227" style="s2">to its source.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.727" end="00:54:59.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s actually making decisions.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.027" end="00:55:05.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he keeps attacking the control</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.327" end="00:55:05.727" style="s2">source.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.527" end="00:55:13.228" style="s2">Now he&#39;s the one choosing.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.528" end="00:55:14.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU ARE SUPPOSED TO BE MY EVIDENCE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.228" end="00:55:17.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M HERE,</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.328" end="00:55:17.728" style="s2">BUT THIS TIME YOU come to me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.128" end="00:55:21.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE SECOND ONE IS BROKEN.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.128" end="00:55:23.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knew what he was doing the whole</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.328" end="00:55:25.628" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.828" end="00:55:27.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And where exactly do you think you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.628" end="00:55:30.828" style="s2">running?</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.228" end="00:55:30.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those papers won&#39;t save you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.928" end="00:55:34.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut off his reinforcements.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.228" end="00:55:34.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you command.</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.428" end="00:55:41.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The outside control is broken, but the</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.328" end="00:55:41.528" style="s2">curse is still there.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.428" end="00:55:46.328" style="s2">Why aren&#39;t you helping him? Because</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.928" end="00:55:50.528" style="s2">someday I won&#39;t be there, and he still</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.328" end="00:55:50.528" style="s2">needs to know he can do this himself.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.828" end="00:55:58.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think this means you&#39;ve won?</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.728" end="00:56:00.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.128" end="00:56:02.328" style="s2">The outer restraints are gone.</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.528" end="00:56:04.628" style="s2">The ones inside him remains.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.328" end="00:56:07.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The main vein is weakening, but the core</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.628" end="00:56:07.528" style="s2">is still reacting.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.128" end="00:56:14.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is what breaking free looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.728" end="00:56:17.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.928" end="00:56:20.328" style="s2">I still have one last thing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.528" end="00:56:23.228" style="s2">The main vein is broken, but the core</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.328" end="00:56:23.228" style="s2">remains.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.028" end="00:56:28.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look at the core.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.628" end="00:56:30.728" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.328" end="00:56:32.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO ONE LEAVES.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.728" end="00:56:34.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET THESE TO THE OUTER HALL.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.528" end="00:56:36.428" style="s2">SPLIT UP. Get the evidence out by two</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.528" end="00:56:38.928" style="s2">routes.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.428" end="00:56:41.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll use you to force him.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.928" end="00:56:41.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.828" end="00:56:47.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill me now [clears throat] or watch her</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.428" end="00:56:51.928" style="s2">die.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.928" end="00:56:51.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUR MAJESTY, HOLD ON.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.128" end="00:56:57.928" style="s2">IT WAS YOU ALL ALONG.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.628" end="00:57:00.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ONCE I TAKE the throne,</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.928" end="00:57:03.228" style="s2">I&#39;ll write the history.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.228" end="00:57:03.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it to Rowan.</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.328" end="00:57:07.428" style="s2">This time I won&#39;t use anyone else&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.928" end="00:57:11.129" style="s2">seal. Don&#39;t look only at me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.428" end="00:57:11.129" style="s2">The palace still you lucid.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.929" end="00:57:18.629" style="s2">Alara told me to give this to you. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.729" end="00:57:22.229" style="s2">looking for an angle.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.629" end="00:57:22.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T TRY ANYTHING.</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.129" end="00:57:28.329" style="s2">MONSTER.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.329" end="00:57:28.329" style="s2">CHOOSE.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.329" end="00:57:31.929" style="s2">ONE MORE STEP AND I KILL HER.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.234" end="00:57:34.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.929" end="00:57:37.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;S WAITING FOR AN OPENING.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.829" end="00:57:37.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t shoot.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.429" end="00:57:41.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.404" end="00:57:42.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.529" end="00:57:44.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.829" end="00:57:46.829" style="s2">PROVE YOU&#39;RE THE MONSTER THEY SAY YOU</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.529" end="00:57:49.629" style="s2">ARE.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.829" end="00:57:49.629" style="s2">SEIZE CASSIAN.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.329" end="00:57:56.529" style="s2">YOU NEED ME TO CONTROL THE CURSE.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.329" end="00:57:56.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU NEVER CONTROLLED IT.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.429" end="00:58:02.829" style="s2">You only exploited it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.729" end="00:58:02.829" style="s2">All the evidence is here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.929" end="00:58:08.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.129" end="00:58:08.129" style="s2">The curse hasn&#39;t stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.029" end="00:58:12.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.129" end="00:58:14.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The skin isn&#39;t broken.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.629" end="00:58:16.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.029" end="00:58:19.029" style="s2">THEN YOU&#39;LL FINALLY LOOK LIKE A KING.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.329" end="00:58:19.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take him away.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.429" end="00:58:22.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s more of a king than the man who is</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.929" end="00:58:25.929" style="s2">sitting on that throne.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.929" end="00:58:25.929" style="s2">Don&#39;t celebrate yet.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.229" end="00:58:31.629" style="s2">Cassian is defeated, but the curse isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.629" end="00:58:33.329" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.629" end="00:58:35.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His Majesty still cannot return to human</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.329" end="00:58:37.029" style="s2">form.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.329" end="00:58:39.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty, the remaining guards await</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.029" end="00:58:41.529" style="s2">your orders.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.229" end="00:58:41.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kyle.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.429" end="00:58:44.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to take command of the</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.329" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">remaining guards?</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.529" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s handing over military command.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.329" end="00:58:53.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I [snorts] accept the command.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.729" end="00:58:57.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The order is clear.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.629" end="00:58:59.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seal the armoury, clear the inner court,</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.629" end="00:59:01.529" style="s2">and keep the side gate open for the</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.029" end="00:59:01.529" style="s2">wounded.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.029" end="00:59:06.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Treat the wounded first, then clear the</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.229" end="00:59:06.829" style="s2">inner court.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.829" end="00:59:12.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I withdraw what I said earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.929" end="00:59:14.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.829" end="00:59:18.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carry</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.331" end="00:59:18.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the military orders. I&#39;ll stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.531" end="00:59:23.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.731" end="00:59:24.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His judgment is proven. Now we save his</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.631" end="00:59:27.031" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.931" end="00:59:28.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t an injury.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.031" end="00:59:29.791" style="s2">The curse is locking his body in this</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.631" end="00:59:30.431" style="s2">form.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.791" end="00:59:32.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.431" end="00:59:34.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s turning to stone.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.931" end="00:59:36.731" style="s2">At Alden, tell me how much time we have.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.831" end="00:59:40.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it reaches his heart, he&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.731" end="00:59:40.331" style="s2">trapped in beast form forever.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.531" end="00:59:45.131" style="s2">Medicine won&#39;t stop this. The curse</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.031" end="00:59:48.431" style="s2">itself is rebounding.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.131" end="00:59:50.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we go back to where it truly began.</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.431" end="00:59:51.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The altar lies at the deepest point of</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.031" end="00:59:54.031" style="s2">the main vein.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.031" end="00:59:55.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we don&#39;t come back, hold the capital.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.031" end="00:59:56.831" style="s2">Do not send people underground to die</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.631" end="00:59:58.331" style="s2">after us.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.831" end="01:00:00.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll hold it,</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.331" end="01:00:02.331" style="s2">but you will come back.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.931" end="01:00:03.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king gave you commands so you could</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.331" end="01:00:06.931" style="s2">hold the army,</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.631" end="01:00:06.931" style="s2">not follow us into danger.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.781" end="01:00:09.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.931" end="01:00:12.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.031" end="01:00:20.931" style="s2">I&#39;m only here to judge his physical</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.631" end="01:00:20.931" style="s2">condition. I won&#39;t touch the altar.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.131" end="01:00:25.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time it takes my blood,</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.531" end="01:00:27.731" style="s2">not the necklace.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.131" end="01:00:29.531" style="s2">The first sealed door opens tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.731" end="01:00:31.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the petrification reaches his chest,</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.531" end="01:00:34.131" style="s2">his heart will stop too.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.631" end="01:00:35.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we don&#39;t waste a second.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.131" end="01:00:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s already moving toward his heart.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.731" end="01:00:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the final page of the covenant.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.131" end="01:00:45.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only open the seal.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.931" end="01:00:45.831" style="s2">Do not take the curse onto yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.031" end="01:00:49.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My blood is only the key.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.031" end="01:00:52.031" style="s2">Cael,</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.331" end="01:00:55.531" style="s2">remember your name.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.031" end="01:00:55.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t delay any longer.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.631" end="01:01:03.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t pull it out for you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.231" end="01:01:06.077" style="s2">You have to seize it yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.831" end="01:01:06.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s almost at his heart.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.077" end="01:01:09.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.231" end="01:01:09.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here, but I won&#39;t do it for you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.931" end="01:01:17.332" style="s2">There is no throne here to end the curse</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.932" end="01:01:17.332" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.032" end="01:01:23.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He understands the rule.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.732" end="01:01:23.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know it hurts.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.072" end="01:01:29.532" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.832" end="01:01:29.532" style="s2">Pain doesn&#39;t mean you&#39;ve lost yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.732" end="01:01:35.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, we can&#39;t wait any longer.</p>
<p begin="01:01:32.932" end="01:01:37.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half an hour at most.</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.732" end="01:01:40.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get your footing first, then seize the</p>
<p begin="01:01:37.432" end="01:01:40.032" style="s2">root of the curse.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.532" end="01:01:43.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keeping your judgment matters more than</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.932" end="01:01:45.932" style="s2">brute force.</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.532" end="01:01:45.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try again.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.632" end="01:01:52.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s trying to make him give up.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.832" end="01:01:54.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CAEL, LOOK AT ME.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.432" end="01:01:56.932" style="s2">I lost my name once. Other people chose</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.832" end="01:01:59.432" style="s2">my life for me too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.932" end="01:02:01.832" style="s2">So I know the last step has to be taken</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.432" end="01:02:05.032" style="s2">back by your own hand.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.832" end="01:02:08.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guard your name. Guard your heart. The</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.032" end="01:02:11.232" style="s2">covenant is responding to him.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.632" end="01:02:11.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.932" end="01:02:17.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One last section.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.932" end="01:02:21.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.832" end="01:02:21.032" style="s2">You are not the curse.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.332" end="01:02:26.432" style="s2">You are Cael.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.332" end="01:02:26.432" style="s2">End it yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.032" end="01:02:31.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He pulled it out.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.632" end="01:02:33.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look at the wall. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.632" end="01:02:35.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were afraid of hurting people.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.732" end="01:02:35.932" style="s2">That&#39;s why you kept choosing not to hurt</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.332" end="01:02:37.432" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.932" end="01:02:38.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His consciousness is repressing the</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.432" end="01:02:40.432" style="s2">backlash.</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.532" end="01:02:42.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saving the attendants, saving Serena,</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.432" end="01:02:44.332" style="s2">sparing Cassian, those were all your</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.032" end="01:02:47.332" style="s2">choices.</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.332" end="01:02:47.332" style="s2">That&#39;s your answer.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.332" end="01:02:52.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s working.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.932" end="01:02:55.132" style="s2">Keep going.</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.432" end="01:02:57.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last strike is yours.</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.132" end="01:02:57.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cael.</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.232" end="01:03:01.932" style="s2">Wake up. Don&#39;t sleep here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.232" end="01:03:05.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say the last step was mine to</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.532" end="01:03:05.832" style="s2">take?</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.932" end="01:03:09.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say you could scare me to</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.532" end="01:03:09.932" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.732" end="01:03:14.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.932" end="01:03:14.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on,</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.132" end="01:03:18.733" style="s2">I don&#39;t have to fear what you&#39;ll turn</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.333" end="01:03:18.733" style="s2">into.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.233" end="01:03:27.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, just look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.533" end="01:03:28.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still silver gray.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.433" end="01:03:31.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to check every time</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.733" end="01:03:31.133" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.633" end="01:03:36.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Habits take longer to break than curses.</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.433" end="01:03:40.133" style="s2">It will be kept only as evidence, never</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.833" end="01:03:44.333" style="s2">again as medicine or a weapon.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.133" end="01:03:44.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seal it away. No one touches it again.</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.533" end="01:03:48.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My body is finally mine.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.033" end="01:03:52.933" style="s2">Go take back your kingdom.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.733" end="01:03:55.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First, we hear the case from 15 years</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.933" end="01:03:55.233" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.433" end="01:04:01.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serena forced me to do all of it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.933" end="01:04:03.584" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you&#39;re putting this on me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.633" end="01:04:04.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who forged my debt contract?</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.584" end="01:04:05.833" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.133" end="01:04:08.633" style="s2">I only wanted my own daughter to have a</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.833" end="01:04:08.633" style="s2">better life.</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.733" end="01:04:15.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why was the seven-year-old girl you</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.733" end="01:04:15.133" style="s2">took in never entered into any record?</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.233" end="01:04:21.433" style="s2">I didn&#39;t write the name, and that isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.133" end="01:04:23.233" style="s2">even a complete fingerprint.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.433" end="01:04:25.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember red ink from the seal pad on</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.233" end="01:04:25.633" style="s2">her hand.</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.633" end="01:04:30.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was only afraid Serena would lose her</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.833" end="01:04:31.533" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.133" end="01:04:33.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have stayed and investigated</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.533" end="01:04:35.679" style="s2">back then.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.533" end="01:04:36.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wasn&#39;t the one who actually sold me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.679" end="01:04:38.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.733" end="01:04:41.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I raised [screaming] you for 15 years.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.933" end="01:04:43.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And for 15 years, you treated me like a</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.833" end="01:04:45.433" style="s2">servant.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.233" end="01:04:48.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sentences for the remaining charges will</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.433" end="01:04:48.733" style="s2">be handed down tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:52.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t think you&#39;ll come out clean,</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.733" end="01:04:55.333" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.533" end="01:04:58.533" style="s2">I never told them to tie you up.</p>
<p begin="01:04:55.333" end="01:05:01.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you traded my life for her chance.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.533" end="01:05:03.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell them what I did.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.533" end="01:05:06.833" style="s2">The necklace, the identity, the</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.333" end="01:05:08.333" style="s2">testimony, none of it was mine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.833" end="01:05:12.233" style="s2">No one forced me to do the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.333" end="01:05:14.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without me, you&#39;re nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.233" end="01:05:16.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fed me that life for 15 years.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.633" end="01:05:20.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The false identity no longer carries any</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.833" end="01:05:20.133" style="s2">privilege or immunity.</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.233" end="01:05:26.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept that. Doing one right thing</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.135" end="01:05:27.335" style="s2">doesn&#39;t erase everything before it. I</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.035" end="01:05:28.935" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.335" end="01:05:30.535" style="s2">Inventory and return everything that</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.935" end="01:05:33.835" style="s2">isn&#39;t mine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.535" end="01:05:33.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It will be handled according to law.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.035" end="01:05:38.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may take what truly belongs to you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.135" end="01:05:39.935" style="s2">So little of it was ever truly mine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.435" end="01:05:42.635" style="s2">Then start your life with what truly</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.935" end="01:05:42.635" style="s2">belongs to you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.835" end="01:05:46.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Highness, we can begin preparing</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.535" end="01:05:47.935" style="s2">for the succession ceremony now.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.535" end="01:05:49.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First restore the reputations of the</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.935" end="01:05:52.535" style="s2">loyal menticuses implicated during the</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.635" end="01:05:52.535" style="s2">falsehood period.</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.935" end="01:05:57.235" style="s2">A crown isn&#39;t a reward. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.735" end="01:06:00.435" style="s2">responsibility.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.235" end="01:06:00.435" style="s2">At least this road is mine.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.235" end="01:06:04.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Royal Highness, take the oath of</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.635" end="01:06:06.835" style="s2">succession.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.835" end="01:06:10.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept the responsibility without</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.835" end="01:06:10.935" style="s2">giving up my right to choose.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.235" end="01:06:12.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.935" end="01:06:13.035" style="s2">Majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.035" end="01:06:14.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It should be placed in the Royal</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.035" end="01:06:16.935" style="s2">Treasury as a sacred relic of the</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.535" end="01:06:18.935" style="s2">Queen&#39;s bloodline.</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.935" end="01:06:20.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The throne didn&#39;t give it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.935" end="01:06:22.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But it once proved your identity.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.535" end="01:06:23.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bloodstone, the genealogy and the</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.035" end="01:06:25.735" style="s2">succession decree have already done</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.435" end="01:06:25.735" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.735" end="01:06:29.735" style="s2">This is simply something my mother left</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.235" end="01:06:31.635" style="s2">to her daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.735" end="01:06:35.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the Queen could see this, she would</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.635" end="01:06:35.135" style="s2">finally be at peace.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.935" end="01:06:41.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.735" end="01:06:42.935" style="s2">this time I took my name back myself.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.235" end="01:06:43.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; War has cut the northern grain route in</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.935" end="01:06:46.235" style="s2">two places.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.935" end="01:06:49.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once the crown is on,</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.235" end="01:06:51.235" style="s2">the work begins.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.235" end="01:06:52.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now this feels like a real succession</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.235" end="01:06:54.035" style="s2">ceremony.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.535" end="01:06:56.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now we can finally get to the private</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.035" end="01:06:57.835" style="s2">message.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.635" end="01:06:59.126" style="s2">Of course he didn&#39;t write me into the</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.835" end="01:07:01.146" style="s2">terms.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.126" end="01:07:01.146" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.035" end="01:07:07.935" style="s2">A crown can&#39;t replace a name.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.235" end="01:07:11.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s what her mother left her.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.035" end="01:07:16.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now it only needs to belong to me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.435" end="01:07:20.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The King of Valencia has personally</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.735" end="01:07:23.035" style="s2">delivered the alliance treaty.</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.935" end="01:07:23.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Valencia made no marriage proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.035" end="01:07:24.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He left that question for</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.836" end="01:07:26.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me to answer myself.</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.936" end="01:07:29.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the two of you marry in the future,</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.436" end="01:07:29.736" style="s2">what happens to the two thrones?</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.936" end="01:07:33.336" style="s2">If the two of you marry in the future,</p>
<p begin="01:07:31.336" end="01:07:35.836" style="s2">what happens to the two thrones?</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.336" end="01:07:39.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; crowns remain permanently independent.</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.836" end="01:07:42.036" style="s2">Marriage changes no line of succession.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.336" end="01:07:45.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty is going in person?</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.036" end="01:07:47.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is my private answer.</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.336" end="01:07:47.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty.</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.136" end="01:07:50.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you&#39;ve brought it back again, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.436" end="01:07:52.436" style="s2">accept it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.736" end="01:07:54.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no marriage in the treaty.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.436" end="01:07:57.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because marriage should never be a</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.036" end="01:07:59.936" style="s2">condition between kingdoms.</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.436" end="01:07:59.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.736" end="01:08:04.936" style="s2">Then the only question left belongs to</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.536" end="01:08:04.936" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.636" end="01:08:11.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t ask for a consort seat.</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.536" end="01:08:13.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are following the rules.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.536" end="01:08:16.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to see you,</p>
<p begin="01:08:13.436" end="01:08:18.036" style="s2">not to take your throne.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.136" end="01:08:19.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Valencia retains its own laws of</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.036" end="01:08:22.036" style="s2">succession.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.036" end="01:08:22.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And so does Aster.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.036" end="01:08:31.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, no ministers.</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.536" end="01:08:31.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then may I ask a private question?</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.636" end="01:08:34.936" style="s2">Allies need trust,</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.636" end="01:08:37.836" style="s2">not hostages.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.936" end="01:08:40.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still choose you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.836" end="01:08:41.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both kingdoms are still independent.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.336" end="01:08:44.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Majesty finally doesn&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.836" end="01:08:45.836" style="s2">worry about the curse flaring up today.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.736" end="01:08:48.236" style="s2">I&#39;m only worried she&#39;s walking too</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.836" end="01:08:48.236" style="s2">slowly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.936" end="01:08:53.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother,</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.336" end="01:08:55.136" style="s2">I made it here on my own.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.236" end="01:08:57.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time there is no debt contract, no</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.136" end="01:08:59.736" style="s2">deal, and no alliance condition.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.536" end="01:09:02.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why I&#39;m standing here.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.736" end="01:09:04.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a single clause will be read aloud.</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.936" end="01:09:05.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The treaty was signed yesterday. Today</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.736" end="01:09:07.136" style="s2">we&#39;re only getting married.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.936" end="01:09:08.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kingdom business stays with the</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.136" end="01:09:10.536" style="s2">kingdoms.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.336" end="01:09:13.836" style="s2">Today belongs to us.</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.536" end="01:09:13.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now this feels like a wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.236" end="01:09:19.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At last, everything is back where it</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.036" end="01:09:19.536" style="s2">belongs.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.036" end="01:09:26.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I kiss you now?</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.236" end="01:09:26.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time you don&#39;t have to ask twice.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.338" end="01:09:33.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At last, no one is deciding for us.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
